{
    "title": "hoopla Digital",
    "description": "Discover limitless entertainment and knowledge with hoopla Digital. Access more than 1.5 million audiobooks, eBooks, comics and manga, music, movies, TV, and more with BingePass. Read, listen, and watch 24/7 without ads or late fees, free with your library card! \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcda eBooks: From gripping mysteries to thought-provoking non-fiction; heartwarming romance to captivating historical tales, hoopla's vast eBook collection celebrates diversity by offering titles that resonate with readers from all walks of life.  \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 Audiobooks: Turn your commute, workout, or leisure time into an enriching experience with our extensive audiobook collection. Listen to captivating narrations by talented performers that bring stories to life. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfac Movies and TV: hoopla's expansive video content library offers popular movies, TV shows, and BingePasses for every age and interest. Whether you're in the mood for Hollywood blockbusters or indie gems, you'll find it all here. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 Music: From chart-topping hits to hidden gems, dig into a music library that suits your every mood. Create playlists, check out new artists, and enjoy uninterrupted album streaming. Or use the shuffle feature to have songs randomly played from one album or all albums you have currently borrowed. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcac Comics and Manga: Read classic comic, graphic novel, and manga series, discover fresh titles, and follow your favorite characters on exciting adventures. Our groundbreaking ActionView reading technology brings comics and manga to life with a panel-by-panel reading experience. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd13 hoopla BingePass: With just one borrow, get unlimited access to entire collections of content for a limited time. It\u2019s a great way to explore awesome online content\u2014and a lot of it! \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce5 Stream or Download: With no waiting, titles can be streamed immediately or downloaded to phones or tablets for offline enjoyment. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude97 Android Auto Compatibility: Access your favorite content on the go\u2014whether you're embarking on a road trip or just running errands\u2014by integrating your entertainment experience with your vehicle using Android Auto.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Easy Access: Seamlessly switch between devices and pick up right where you left off. Your bookmarks sync across platforms, ensuring you never lose your place in a great story. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf12 Dark Theme: Enjoy reading and browsing comfortably in low-light environments with hoopla's Dark Theme. Enhance your viewing experience and reduce eye strain during nighttime use. \r\n\r\n\r\nhoopla puts your public library at your fingertips\u2014all you need is a library card. Download the app today! Content availability may vary based on library participation.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover limitless entertainment and knowledge with hoopla Digital. Access more than 1.5 million audiobooks, eBooks, comics and manga, music, movies, TV, and more with BingePass. Read, listen, and watch 24/7 without ads or late fees, free with your library card! <br><br>\ud83d\udcda eBooks: From gripping mysteries to thought-provoking non-fiction; heartwarming romance to captivating historical tales, hoopla&#39;s vast eBook collection celebrates diversity by offering titles that resonate with readers from all walks of life.  <br><br>\ud83c\udfa7 Audiobooks: Turn your commute, workout, or leisure time into an enriching experience with our extensive audiobook collection. Listen to captivating narrations by talented performers that bring stories to life. <br><br>\ud83c\udfac Movies and TV: hoopla&#39;s expansive video content library offers popular movies, TV shows, and BingePasses for every age and interest. Whether you&#39;re in the mood for Hollywood blockbusters or indie gems, you&#39;ll find it all here. <br><br>\ud83c\udfb6 Music: From chart-topping hits to hidden gems, dig into a music library that suits your every mood. Create playlists, check out new artists, and enjoy uninterrupted album streaming. Or use the shuffle feature to have songs randomly played from one album or all albums you have currently borrowed. <br><br>\ud83d\udcac Comics and Manga: Read classic comic, graphic novel, and manga series, discover fresh titles, and follow your favorite characters on exciting adventures. Our groundbreaking ActionView reading technology brings comics and manga to life with a panel-by-panel reading experience. <br><br>\ud83d\udd13 hoopla BingePass: With just one borrow, get unlimited access to entire collections of content for a limited time. It\u2019s a great way to explore awesome online content\u2014and a lot of it! <br><br>\ud83d\udce5 Stream or Download: With no waiting, titles can be streamed immediately or downloaded to phones or tablets for offline enjoyment. <br><br>\ud83d\ude97 Android Auto Compatibility: Access your favorite content on the go\u2014whether you&#39;re embarking on a road trip or just running errands\u2014by integrating your entertainment experience with your vehicle using Android Auto.<br><br>\ud83d\udcf1 Easy Access: Seamlessly switch between devices and pick up right where you left off. Your bookmarks sync across platforms, ensuring you never lose your place in a great story. <br><br>\ud83c\udf12 Dark Theme: Enjoy reading and browsing comfortably in low-light environments with hoopla&#39;s Dark Theme. Enhance your viewing experience and reduce eye strain during nighttime use. <br><br><br>hoopla puts your public library at your fingertips\u2014all you need is a library card. Download the app today! Content availability may vary based on library participation.",
